! mcp_bootstrap_p242.strap -- MCP printed page 242: the R W.. tape
! positioning / R E.. error-retry section (RWSET .. RENGJB), lines 1-49.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_001-249.pdf PDF p.249, read at 400 dpi, 900/1800 dpi
! for doubtful glyphs.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID
! 11D11MCP  CARD ID CB000038  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 242";
! the heading row's LOCATION field is 227552, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  49 lines, all located, contiguous from 227552.00 to
! 227603.00 (a full word CM; next location 227604.00), then blank
! paper.  The volume reading puts p.241's last row at 227551.40 (a
! half word) and p.243's line 1 at 227604.00, so the page joins both.
! No remarks are printed.  Asterisks after the LOCATION on lines 3,
! 24, 47.  Lines 13, 15, 21, 28, 30, 39 are VF data words (value
! printed with a "+" suffix).
!
! LABEL SPELLINGS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 6 "RW TCNG" = RWTONG, line 12 "RW NCEG" = RWNOEG (and line 9
!     ",RWNCEG"): at 1800 dpi the glyph is as wide as line 7's closed O
!     in REJJOB, wider than the real C of LCI/DMCP in the same rows, and
!     has no D stem.  Line 9's BZBZ h2 prints 227560.74 = line 12's
!     227560.40, so the reference and the label are the same symbol.
!     Neither name is in any landed deck.
!   * line 7 "REJJOB" prints a CLOSED O; line 9 prints it open
!     ("REJJCB") -- same symbol, same 230364.77.
!   * line 7 "RWSTCR", line 16 "RESTCR": open O, written RWSTOR/RESTOR
!     (RE STORe).  C22-6728 (OCR) prints RESTOR; RWSTOR rests on ink.
!   * line 44 "REDOBL" (sheet read RECOBL) and line 31 "RERDUK": the
!     third/fourth glyph has the straight left stem of D, the same
!     worn-bowl D as line 39's "CERGS" = landed DERGS.
!     C22-6728 (OCR) prints "a REDOBL entry" and RERDUK, RWSET, RWEE.
!   * lines 13/21/28/39 print "DW", "CSPFL", "CRD"/"DRC", "CERGS": the
!     landed p.104 D-names DW, DSPFL, DRD, DERGS (VF values 1.32, 6.32,
!     1.0, 5.01 print exactly).
!   * line 40 prints "VSL(VU)": the U's right stem is worn; no VSL is
!     defined anywhere, and the binary 000006.01 B3 is lines 14/22/29's
!     LVE,,VSU(VU) bit for bit (VSU = VID.VH = 6.0, p.213 line 18).
!     Written VSU.
!   * line 1 "RWEXIT-2.C", line 42 "-1.C($13)", line 47 "RKC+1.C":
!     a round glyph in a number is 0.
!   * hex bytes printed with an open round ("C0", "C1", "C2", "FC")
!     are 0; octal fields "CCCCCC.CC" are 0.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  Right-hand serials run ?B000038 .. ?B000069 (prefix a
! round glyph; the header prints it "CB000038", the column mostly "0B").
! The deck's serials start afresh at 038 on this page.  Shared serials:
! 2/3 (039), 4/5 (040), 10/11 (045), 12-15 (046), 16/17 (047), 20-22
! (050), 27-30 (055), 38-40 (063), 42/43 (065), 44/45 (066), 47/48
! (068).  No serial is skipped.

VU      SYN, $3                      ! p.213 line 25 "V U SYN,$3"
VSU     SYN, 6.0                     ! p.213 line 18 = VID.VH = 6.0
VRCNT   SYN, 7.0                     ! p.213 line 20 = VRQB.VH = 7.0
VWCW    SYN, (8)225272.0             ! landed decks; VF line 15 prints 225272.00+
DMCP    SYN, 32.0                    ! landed p.108
DW      SYN, 1.32                    ! landed p.104 "D W"
DSPFL   SYN, 6.32                    ! landed p.104 "D SPFL"
DRD     SYN, 1.0                     ! landed p.104 "D RD"
DERGS   SYN, 5.01                    ! landed p.104 "D ERG S"
RWEXIT  SYN(BU,32), (8)227646.0      ! p.244 (scratch) line 8 "RWEXIT DRZ(BU,32),4" at 227646.00; p.219 writes SYN, (8)227646.0
RWREST  SYN, (8)227545.0             ! B line 5, half word only
RKD     SYN, 3.0                     ! as p.244 (scratch) writes it, volume OCR "RKD SYN, 3.0"; LCI line 6 RKD+1.0 = 000004
REJJOB  SYN, (8)230364.0             ! BZB1/BZBZ lines 7/9 REJJOB+.63 = 230364.77, BIT-EXACT
RWSTOR  SYN, (8)227546.40            ! BZB1 line 7 h2, half word only
RESTOR  SYN, (8)230316.40            ! LVI line 16 .77 = .40 + 2*15+1, this page's binary only
RTN     SYN, (8)230103.40            ! B lines 17/34, half word only
REBSP1  SYN, (8)230334.0             ! LVI line 19 / BZXVZ line 26, this page's binary only
RK4P32  SYN, (8)230271.0             ! B line 23, half word only
RESKIP  SYN, (8)230250.0             ! VF line 30 prints 230250.00+, BIT-EXACT
RERDUK  SYN, (8)230324.0             ! LVI line 31, this page's binary only
READ    SYN, (8)230325.0             ! LVI line 33, this page's binary only
